{"publicId":"45aab7a3-129a-4e93-b66d-82ff5fddfc9a","title":"Bitwise申请在德克萨斯州证券交易所上市Zcash现货ETF未获批","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T17:57:01.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-19T17:57:01.000Z","digest":"Bitwise资产管理公司向美国SEC提交S-1注册声明，申请在未受SEC监管的德克萨斯州证券交易所（TXSE）上市直接持有Zcash现货的ETF（代码ZEC），由Coinbase托管并Bitwise投资顾问公司管理，但该ETF尚未开始交易且注册声明未生效【新】。早前草案计划在NYSE Arca上市，后因Zcash作为隐私币种面临传统ETF监管障碍转向争议性监管地位的TXSE，目前仅披露管理费未明确具体费率或地域限制【新】。\n\nZcash ETF若获批将允许投资者通过传统证券市场间接持有Zcash，但需解决隐私币合规性难题。SEC尚未对TXSE的监管地位做出明确表态，而Bitwise此前曾因类似问题在NYSE Arca上市失败【新】。\n\n当前进展：SEC已收到Bitwise提交的注册材料，但尚未完成审核或作出批准决定；托管方Coinbase和管理人Bitwise Investment Advisers已确认合作框架，但具体费率、托管规模及交易时间表均未公布。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-19T18:28:04.266Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Bitwise 申请 SEC 对 Zcash ETF 的注册","latestReport":{"id":"lw2rzyts3u597tiixnbjskqnf"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":3,"newParticipants6h":1,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fxzLIuoOBilQ","title":"Bitwise Files SEC Registration for a Zcash ETF","firstReportAt":"2026-11-19T17:57:01.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"lw2rzyts3u597tiixnbjskqnf","title":"Bitwise 申请 SEC 对 Zcash ETF 的注册","summary":"Bitwise 正式提交 Zcash ETF 的 SEC 注册申请，当前状态为未生效。该 ETF 计划持有 Zcash 以使股东获得其价格（扣除费用），但注册声明尚未生效。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T17:57:01.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"lw2rzyts3u597tiixnbjskqnf","title":"Bitwise 申请 SEC 对 Zcash ETF 的注册","summary":"Bitwise 正式提交 Zcash ETF 的 SEC 注册申请，当前状态为未生效。该 ETF 计划持有 Zcash 以使股东获得其价格（扣除费用），但注册声明尚未生效。","source":{"name":"The Defiant","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-19T17:57:01.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-18T14:00:00.000Z","heat":18.2,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-18T15:00:00.000Z","heat":17.7,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-18T16:00:00.000Z","heat":17.2,"participants":2},{"hour":"2026-11-18T17:00:00.000Z","heat":16.7,"participants